{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はえりか様と\nランチして\n映画観てきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ソロモンの偽証』観てきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部作にわかれてて\n今やってるのは前編で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後編は4/11からみたい！\n楽しみだなー( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く観たい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方からは\n友達とご飯行ってまったりしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら\n旅行行ってた友達２人も来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら\n母校の先生２人も来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら\n集まってた場所の近くでバイトしてた友達も来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果7人でご飯食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの行動力！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分 同窓会だった！\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『OVERTURE』の妄フェスの企画に\n中田の妄想セットリストが載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がアイドルフェスを開催するなら\nどういう10曲を選曲するか\n一生懸命考えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"様々なアイドル好きの方々の中\n中田も提案させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のページには乃木坂もたくさん載ってたよ！\nなーちゃん表紙が目印です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日発売\n『埼玉ウォーカー2015春』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙やらせていただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！！！本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織以外の埼玉出身メンバー\n真夏、さゆにゃん、ちーちゃん、琴子、まいちゅん、中田の6人で\n載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影楽しかったなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/24/2659476/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい笑っちゃったところ\n撮られてた(´,,•ω•,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}